git repo: https://github.com/wstolte/rwsapi.git

####################### branch: develop-wadar-adaptation #########################
2025-01-23: Git clone of this specific branch, which is now copy of the master
2025-01-23: Replacement of old metadata and metadata2 functions by one metadata
            function. The most important changes are:
            1. Update of server address and path to only use the new production
               version of the API.
            2. All names to small letters for uniformity and normalization if API
               side changes (easier to maintain).
            3. Use of require instead of library (require is less verbose) and
            4. Explicit namespaces (not entire package has to be loaded)
            5. Adjustment of list of fields to obtain (changed in new API
               version).
2025-01-23: Replacement of old observations2 function by a new observations
            function. The most important changes are:
            1. Update of server address and path to only use the new production
               version.
            2. All names to small letters for uniformity and normalization if API
               side changes (easier to maintain).
            3. Use of require instead of library (require is less verbose)
            4. Explicit use of namespaces (not entire package has to be loaded).
            5. Variable mapping with names instead of indices (easier to maintain
               and debug; order changed in new API and some fields are no longer
               present).
2025-01-23: Roxygen framework is extended to include a NAMESPACE file construction
            based on a <packagename>.R file.
2025-01-24: Package dependencies are cleaned up. The dependency on magrittr is
            removed by removing all the pipes. Reason: package compilation is
            cumbersome with magrittr dependencies.

